Link: https://syzkaller.appspot.com/ai_job?id=5abbe65a-5853-4bc2-9135-5c75f88d51ed
Signed-off-by: Aleksandr Nogikh <nogikh@google.com>
Signed-off-by: Hans Verkuil <hverkuil+cisco@kernel.org>
